<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Podcast Directory</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .podcast-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .podcast-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .podcast-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        .podcast-title {
            color: #34495e;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        }
        .podcast-description {
            color: #7f8c8d;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Azure Tech Podcasts</h1>
    
    <div class="podcast-grid">
        <div class="podcast-card">
            <h2 class="podcast-title">Azure Friday</h2>
            <p class="podcast-description">Scott Hanselman hosts discussions with Azure engineers about various Azure services and features, diving deep into technical implementations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="podcast-card">
            <h2 class="podcast-title">Microsoft Cloud Show</h2>
            <p class="podcast-description">Weekly podcast covering Microsoft Azure, Office 365, SharePoint, and everything cloud-related in the Microsoft ecosystem.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="podcast-card">
            <h2 class="podcast-title">Azure DevOps Podcast</h2>
            <p class="podcast-description">Focused discussions on DevOps practices in Azure, featuring interviews with industry experts and Microsoft engineers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="podcast-card">
            <h2 class="podcast-title">Azure Security Podcast</h2>
            <p class="podcast-description">Deep dives into Azure security features, best practices, and discussions with security experts about cloud security.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="podcast-card">
            <h2 class="podcast-title">Azure Solutions Architect</h2>
            <p class="podcast-description">Weekly discussions about Azure architecture patterns, best practices, and real-world implementation stories.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="podcast-card">
            <h2 class="podcast-title">Kubernetes on Azure</h2>
            <p class="podcast-description">Everything about running containerized applications on Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) and related technologies.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>